00:10:04.440 --> 00:10:06.934
If you needed it, then take
it and do something about it.

00:10:06.934 --> 00:10:08.720
The reason there's going to be a billion

00:10:08.720 --> 00:10:10.829
motivational views today on YouTube

00:10:10.829 --> 00:10:15.160
is that people love the
feeling of being motivated

00:10:15.160 --> 00:10:16.710
they don't like putting in the work

00:10:16.710 --> 00:10:18.410
to do something about the feeling.

00:10:22.511 --> 00:10:24.773
I hate the motivation me.

00:10:27.270 --> 00:10:29.413
Until you do something about it.

00:10:29.413 --> 00:10:32.163
(peaceful music)

